{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>You can play up to Chapter 1 in the demo version!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The knight \u2018Ail Shell\u2019 lost his memory. He awoke in a dungeon where everything was decided by dice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There he met the witch, \u2018Grin\u2019. Ail gained the aid of \u2018Grin\u2019, who freely manipulates fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To rescue someone trapped in the dungeon and escape himself,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and to recover his lost memories, Ail heads deeper into the dungeon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022590/extras/0fb7a7de7ddc144406284c01cb7f9699.poster.avif?t=1758281065\" width=924 height=510 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022590/extras/0fb7a7de7ddc144406284c01cb7f9699.webm?t=1758281065\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022590/extras/0fb7a7de7ddc144406284c01cb7f9699.mp4?t=1758281065\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Roll, manipulate, roll, manipulate!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this dice-driven adventure, you must actively use Grin's magic!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, events and progression are determined by the dice values \u200b\u200brolled by characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use fate magic to reroll the dice or even change the numbers themselves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The outcome will reshape your future adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022590/extras/92799dadd162df9accb1082aca15b033.poster.avif?t=1758281065\" width=924 height=510 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022590/extras/92799dadd162df9accb1082aca15b033.webm?t=1758281065\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022590/extras/92799dadd162df9accb1082aca15b033.mp4?t=1758281065\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Turn-based combat where dice manipulation overturns the tide of victory!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using skills always requires the right fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Therefore, both allies and enemies must assign skills to the dice and use them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each skill requires a different number of dice, making them difficult to use...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With 'Grin's magic, you can freely manipulate these dice!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create the fate needed to unleash even the hardest-to-use skills!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Of course, enemy dice are no exception!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022590/extras/d66ffd7830cb8a454104a6153298a14b.poster.avif?t=1758281065\" width=924 height=510 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022590/extras/d66ffd7830cb8a454104a6153298a14b.webm?t=1758281065\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022590/extras/d66ffd7830cb8a454104a6153298a14b.mp4?t=1758281065\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What awaits you at the end of your adventure...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your past, revealed as you reclaim your memories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The unknown plans of \u2018Grin\u2019.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Within this dungeon, tangled beyond even magic's reach,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Where exactly will your destiny flow?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022590/extras/ac0547574565781cbbab83ef4e6c7057.poster.avif?t=1758281065\" width=924 height=510 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022590/extras/ac0547574565781cbbab83ef4e6c7057.webm?t=1758281065\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022590/extras/ac0547574565781cbbab83ef4e6c7057.mp4?t=1758281065\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4022590?t=1758281065","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4022590?t=1758281065","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022590/33ad2809125c8321286bf024170f0d228e86d715/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758281065","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022590/33ad2809125c8321286bf024170f0d228e86d715/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758281065","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>You can play up to Chapter 1 in the demo version!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The knight \u2018Ail Shell\u2019 lost his memory. He awoke in a dungeon where everything was decided by dice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There he met the witch, \u2018Grin\u2019. Ail gained the aid of \u2018Grin\u2019, who freely manipulates fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To rescue someone trapped in the dungeon and escape himself,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and to recover his lost memories, Ail heads deeper into the dungeon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022590/extras/0fb7a7de7ddc144406284c01cb7f9699.poster.avif?t=1758281065\" width=924 height=510 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022590/extras/0fb7a7de7ddc144406284c01cb7f9699.webm?t=1758281065\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022590/extras/0fb7a7de7ddc144406284c01cb7f9699.mp4?t=1758281065\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Roll, manipulate, roll, manipulate!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this dice-driven adventure, you must actively use Grin's magic!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, events and progression are determined by the dice values \u200b\u200brolled by characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use fate magic to reroll the dice or even change the numbers themselves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The outcome will reshape your future adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022590/extras/92799dadd162df9accb1082aca15b033.poster.avif?t=1758281065\" width=924 height=510 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022590/extras/92799dadd162df9accb1082aca15b033.webm?t=1758281065\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022590/extras/92799dadd162df9accb1082aca15b033.mp4?t=1758281065\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Turn-based combat where dice manipulation overturns the tide of victory!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using skills always requires the right fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Therefore, both allies and enemies must assign skills to the dice and use them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each skill requires a different number of dice, making them difficult to use...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With 'Grin's magic, you can freely manipulate these dice!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create the fate needed to unleash even the hardest-to-use skills!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Of course, enemy dice are no exception!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022590/extras/d66ffd7830cb8a454104a6153298a14b.poster.avif?t=1758281065\" width=924 height=510 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022590/extras/d66ffd7830cb8a454104a6153298a14b.webm?t=1758281065\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022590/extras/d66ffd7830cb8a454104a6153298a14b.mp4?t=1758281065\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What awaits you at the end of your adventure...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your past, revealed as you reclaim your memories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The unknown plans of \u2018Grin\u2019.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Within this dungeon, tangled beyond even magic's reach,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Where exactly will your destiny flow?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022590/extras/ac0547574565781cbbab83ef4e6c7057.poster.avif?t=1758281065\" width=924 height=510 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_a